ient HTTP 5xx and timeouts, with tests and a docs[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sentence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase-core's master CI is green and the steward stops reporting[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]core_ci_red[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-ci[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-ci: rerun or repair sase-core's red master CI run 42673707335 so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tools/release_watch no longer reports core_ci_red.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]An accepted release.yml rehearsal on the refreshed release PR [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]branch[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]rehearse[dim] · [dim][/dim]after master-reds[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rehearse: refresh the release-please branch onto the fixed master, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dispatch one rehearse-mode release.yml run there, and accept it job by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]job (or skip per the rehearsal decision).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Every workflow that runs on master is green on a tip holding [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]every fix[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ci-green[dim] · [dim][/dim]after master-reds, steward-retry, core-ci[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ci-green: drive Master Gate, Full CI, CI Telemetry, and the Release [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]steward green on a tip holding every phase commit, repair what is still [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]red, and confirm the steward reports the release PR releasable.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase 0.19.0 is merged, published, verified on PyPI, and [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]recorded as artifacts[/b